    "id": "reels1",
    "titulo": "Formatos en tendencia, en clave Barkita",
    "html": "<section id=\"reels1\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#FAF6EE;color:#211714;font-family:Figtree, Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:48px;align-items:stretch\">\n<div style=\"width:400px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Reels</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:64px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-2px\">Formatos en tendencia, en clave Barkita</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1.4;color:#4A3F3A\">Composiciones orientativas con fotos de la marca. Todo en vertical, con subtítulos y estética de móvil.</p>\n<div style=\"flex:1\"></div>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;background:#FCDC8D;padding:10px 22px;border-radius:999px;transform:rotate(-3deg);white-space:nowrap;text-align:center\">Gancho en 3 segundos</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:316px;padding:8px;background:#211714;border-radius:40px\">\n<img src=\"/pitch/barkita/ph-016.jpg\" alt=\"Caniche con la lengua fuera junto a una bolsa de Barkita\" style=\"width:300px;height:520px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:32px\">\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:28px;top:26px;width:260px;height:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border-radius:4px\"></div>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:24px;top:56px;width:268px;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:26px;line-height:1.15;text-align:center;background:#FFFFFF;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:14px\">POV: has oído abrir la bolsa de Barkita</p>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"position:absolute;left:258px;top:330px;width:40px;height:40px;color:#FFFFFF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-4.4-9.3-8.6C1 9 2.8 5 6.5 5c2 0 3.5 1.2 4.5 2.6C12 6.2 13.5 5 15.5 5 19.2 5 21 9 19.3 12.4 17 16.6 12 21 12 21z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"position:absolute;left:258px;top:386px;width:40px;height:40px;color:#FFFFFF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"position:absolute;left:258px;top:442px;width:40px;height:40px;color:#FFFFFF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 3 3 10l7 3 3 7z M10 13l11-10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:28px;top:482px;width:220px;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.1;color:#FFFFFF;text-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)\">@somosbarkita</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">POV · Humor</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;line-height:1.15\">El ruido de la bolsa</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">El perro como protagonista al oír la bolsa, con audio en tendencia y corte al primer bocado.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:316px;padding:8px;background:#211714;border-radius:40px\">\n<img src=\"/pitch/barkita/ph-046.jpg\" alt=\"Textura de nervio de ternera\" style=\"width:300px;height:260px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:32px 32px 0px 0px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px;width:300px;height:260px;background:#D3D1D0;padding:20px 22px;border-radius:0px 0px 32px 32px\"><p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:24px;line-height:1.15;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:line-through\">Harinas · azúcares</p><p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:24px;line-height:1.15;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:line-through\">Glicerina · aromas</p><p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:24px;line-height:1.15;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:line-through\">Conservantes</p></div>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:24px;top:40px;width:268px;font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;text-align:center;background:#FCDC8D;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px\">BARKITA: 1 INGREDIENTE</p>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:24px;top:286px;width:268px;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:24px;line-height:1.1;text-align:center;background:#FFFFFF;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px\">SNACK DEL SÚPER</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Pantalla dividida · Educa</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;line-height:1.15\">Lee las dos etiquetas</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Arriba Barkita, abajo un snack del súper. Gana la etiqueta que se lee en un segundo.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:316px;padding:8px;background:#211714;border-radius:40px\">\n<img src=\"/pitch/barkita/ph-004.jpg\" alt=\"Spaniel mirando una bolsa de boquerón entero\" style=\"width:300px;height:520px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:32px\">\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:28px;top:26px;width:260px;height:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border-radius:4px\"></div>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:24px;top:56px;width:268px;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:26px;line-height:1.15;text-align:center;background:#FFFFFF;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:14px\">Mi perro puntúa los 10 snacks</p>\n<p data-build-in=\"pop\" style=\"position:absolute;left:170px;top:330px;width:130px;font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:44px;line-height:1;text-align:center;background:#FCDC8D;padding:14px 8px;border-radius:999px;transform:rotate(-8deg)\">9/10</p>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:28px;top:482px;width:220px;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.1;color:#FFFFFF;text-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)\">@somosbarkita</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Gochi Hand', 'Brush Script MT', cursive;font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Ranking · Producto</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;line-height:1.15\">La cata de mi perro</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Serie: un sabor por episodio, la reacción del perro y su nota final.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<img src=\"/pitch/barkita/logo-h-cacao.png\" alt=\"Barkita\" style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:66px;width:150px;height:24px;object-fit:contain\">\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:300px;bottom:62px;width:900px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;color:#6B5F58\">Briefing estratégico · Maen Studios × Barkita</p>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;right:128px;bottom:62px;width:120px;text-align:right;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2\">18</p>\n</section>"
